### Create a new event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Torneo Apertura 2026",
  "location": "Estadio Único de La Plata",
  "description": "Torneo oficial de apertura de la temporada",
  "startDate": "2026-03-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-15"
}

### Create another event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Copa Verano 2026",
  "location": "Complejo Deportivo Roca",
  "description": "Torneo amistoso de verano",
  "startDate": "2026-01-15",
  "endDate": "2026-11-28"
}

### Get all events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get active events (non-deleted with at least one club registered)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get active events filtered by a specific club
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/club?clubId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get event by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a club to an event (replace with actual IDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "clubId": 3
}

### Get all registrations for an event (replace with actual event ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start an event (only if status is UPCOMING)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Finish an event (only if status is ONGOING)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
